> "random"? i.e.
>
> lmer(log(CONT) ~ TIME*REGION + WB_TYPE + PORT*len + (1|TIME) +
> (1|REGION/wb_id))

Not a good idea.  As one might expect the fixed and random effects for
the same factor end up confounded with one another.
