From: b.pelzer at maw.ru.nl (Ben Pelzer)
Date: Fri, 04 Nov 2011 11:18:53 +0100
Subject: [R-sig-ME] verbose output / high correlation
In-Reply-To: <20135.49427.778957.283264@stat.math.ethz.ch>
References: <CACB4C4A.16C%jbe47@cornell.edu>
