 multiple x variables
In-Reply-To: <7D14B0574D3F30499CC2B4B4EADC342A98F121648F@ILS131.uopnet.plymouth.ac.uk>
References: <7D14B0574D3F30499CC2B4B4EADC342A98F12162DB@ILS131.uopnet.plymouth.ac.uk>
